{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks to the Demo, you will be able to experience the Mall Simulator 2025 entry-level content and features. Don't forget to add to your wishlist and follow us for the <strong>full version of the game</strong>.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582710/extras/wishlistgif.gif?t=1744726331\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mall Simulator is a chill first-person simulation where you will experience a giant mall tycoon with various stores that you run yourself. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582710/extras/4.png?t=1744726331\" />Design matters! Create the best design for your mall and manage your stores. Showcase your best-seller stores and create the perfect mall for your customers.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582710/extras/store_title_gif_01.gif?t=1744726331\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582710/extras/3.png?t=1744726331\" />Zero to hero! Open new stores of the most famous brands and sell their products in your mall. Expand your stores in the mall from a grocery to a jewellery.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582710/extras/store_title_gif_02.gif?t=1744726331\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582710/extras/1.png?t=1744726331\" />Out of stock? Always supply new products and follow new trends to keep your customers in your mall.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582710/extras/store_title_gif_03.gif?t=1744726331\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582710/extras/5.png?t=1744726331\" />Time is money! Your mall may be busy, take payments and hire new workers so you don't keep your customers waiting.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582710/extras/store_title_gif_04.gif?t=1744726331\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582710/extras/2.png?t=1744726331\" />Smash the walls! Open up new spaces and make room for more stores and brands in your mall.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582710/extras/store_title_gif_05.gif?t=1744726331\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In Mall Simulator, customer satisfaction is neccesary. You have to keep up with trends, make new store openings, set good prices and grow your mall to avoid going bankrupt.</strong></p></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582710?t=1744726331","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582710?t=1744726331","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582710/91b64eb4529e7883ddfe8f9544b1888c6c3b15a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744726331","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582710/91b64eb4529e7883ddfe8f9544b1888c6c3b15a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744726331","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks to the Demo, you will be able to experience the Mall Simulator 2025 entry-level content and features. Don't forget to add to your wishlis